IMPORTANT LICENSING NOTE:

This LogicSpec transpiler ONLY generates Tau Language syntax as text output.
It does NOT include, distribute, or require any Tau Language:
- Source code
- Binaries or executables
- Grammar files (.tgf)
- Runtime libraries
- Any other copyrighted Tau Language materials

To actually execute the generated .tau files, users must:
1. Obtain Tau Language separately from the official source:
   https://github.com/IDNI/tau-lang
2. Accept the Tau Language license terms
3. Build and install according to their instructions
4. Run generated .tau files with the Tau runtime

The Tau Language project has its own license which governs its use.
This transpiler is independently developed and is not affiliated with
or endorsed by the Tau Language project.
